// EVOMUL - workspace = workspace x (matrix in ʟMXW, which must have N rows)
// Clobbers: C I J K O P Q R S X Y G H [G] [H]
ʟMXW(2)→C
{M,C}→dim([G]):{M,C}→dim([H])
For(I,1,M)
For(J,1,C)
0→X:1→Y
For(K,1,N)
If [I](I,K)≠0:Then
[I](I,K)→P:[J](I,K)→Q:ʟMXW(2+2((K-1)C+J))→R:ʟMXW(3+2((K-1)C+J))→S:3→O:prgmEVOFRAC
X→R:Y→S:1→O:prgmEVOFRAC
P→X:Q→Y
End
End
X→[G](I,J):Y→[H](I,J)
End
End
[G]→[I]:[H]→[J]:C→N
max(V,ʟMXW(3))→V
